37
00:01:40.774 --> 00:01:50.232
Puppet, Puppet, Puppet! Crown, Crown, Crown! Costume, Costume, Costume! Mask, Mask, Mask!

38
00:01:50.282 --> 00:01:58.604
Cape, Cape, Cape! Wand, Wand, Wand! Tea set, Tea set! Tent, Tent, Tent!

39
00:01:58.654 --> 00:02:01.886
